### =====================================================
### WD-5669: Signup verify-code - POST /Account/signup/verify-code
### Anónimo con la API key de la app. Hasta 5 intentos por código.
### =====================================================

### Código correcto (200; data = true). Reemplazar por el que llegó al correo
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nueva.empresa@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}

### Código incorrecto → 400 CODE_INVALID (suma un intento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nueva.empresa@example.com",
  "code": "000000",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}

### Sin código vigente (vencido o nunca pedido) → 400 CODE_EXPIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sin.codigo@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}

### Sexto intento con el mismo código → 429 TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nueva.empresa@example.com",
  "code": "000001",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}
